    "approvedEnglish": "A Warm Spot\n\nI am tired. I want to sleep. The sun is warm near the window. I sit on the floor. But the floor is very hard. I cannot sleep well.\n\nI walk to the bed. The bed is soft. I like the bed. Then I hear a sound. My friend Xiao Hei the bird is outside. Xiao Hei says, “Good morning! Do you want to play?” I look at Xiao Hei. I say, “I am tired. I want to sleep.” I close my eyes.\n\nLater, I wake up. Now I am hungry. I walk to the kitchen. I see a small bowl. The bowl is empty. I am not happy. I walk to my owner. The owner is sitting on a chair. I say, “I am hungry. I want to eat.” The owner smiles and stands up. She puts some food in the bowl. I look at the food. The food smells good. I eat the food.\n\nNow I am happy. My stomach is full. The sun is still warm. I walk to the soft bed. I close my green eyes. This time, I sleep very well.",
